.TH std::ranges::take_while_view::take_while_view 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::ranges::take_while_view::take_while_view \- std::ranges::take_while_view::take_while_view

.SH Synopsis
take_while_view() requires std::default_initializable<V> && \fB(1)\fP \fI(since C++20)\fP
std::default_initializable<Pred> = default;
constexpr explicit take_while_view( V base, Pred pred );    \fB(2)\fP \fI(since C++20)\fP

Constructs a take_while_view.

1) Default constructor. Value-initializes the underlying view and the predicate.
2) Move constructs the underlying view base_ from base and the predicate pred_ from pred.

.SH Parameters

base - underlying view
fun  - predicate

